{"id":"aee8e6e7d497c632","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-pebble-kvar.md","title":"卵石游戏刻画有限变量句子","display":"thm-pebble-kvar — 卵石游戏刻画有限变量句子","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-pebble-kvar","aliases":["29-thm-pebble-kvar"],"display":"thm-pebble-kvar — 卵石游戏刻画有限变量句子","depends_on":["[[29-df-pebble-game]]","[[29-df-lk]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-relational-vocab]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 6.10, p.95, DjVu scan 110; game definition pp.92–93, scans 107–108","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-pebble-kvar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-pebble-kvar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pebble-kvar — 卵石游戏刻画有限变量句子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da1408963eb3a178\" href=\"?note=da1408963eb3a178\" title=\"29-df-pebble-game\">29-df-pebble-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de7fc2c34b9d839\" href=\"?note=4de7fc2c34b9d839\" title=\"29-df-lk\">29-df-lk</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 6.10, p.95, DjVu scan 110; game definition pp.92–93, scans 107–108"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>；关系词汇允许常量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^k_\\tau\">\\(L^k_\\tau\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4de7fc2c34b9d839\" href=\"?note=4de7fc2c34b9d839\" title=\"29-df-lk\">29-df-lk</a> 的公式集；本条只比较其中的闭句。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\">\\(G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"da1408963eb3a178\" href=\"?note=da1408963eb3a178\" title=\"29-df-pebble-game\">29-df-pebble-game</a>；初始位置没有个体变量卵石，常量的解释始终受原子一致性约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{L^k}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\cap L^k_\\tau\\;(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{L^k}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\cap L^k_\\tau\\;(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{L^k}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{L^k}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 6.10，印刷页 95、扫描页 110，及游戏定义 pp.92–93、扫描页 107–108。已核对量化秩与卵石数双界的陈述及归纳证明；这里取初始空变量位置，再对全部有限轮数取交。每个有限公式有有限量化秩，反向若某轮失败，则有限关系词汇的有限类型合取给出同变量数的区分公式。旧式用全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^k\">\\(L^k\\)</span> 公式却省略赋值，现明确只比较闭句。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-pebble-game","status":"resolved","id":"da1408963eb3a178","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-pebble-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-lk","status":"resolved","id":"4de7fc2c34b9d839","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-lk]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-relational-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"44836019093a45c6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-lk","status":"resolved","id":"4de7fc2c34b9d839","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L^k_\\tau$ 为 [[29-df-lk]] 的公式集；本条只比较其中的闭句。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-pebble-game","status":"resolved","id":"da1408963eb3a178","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)$ 及 $\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G$ 见 [[29-df-pebble-game]]；初始位置没有个体变量卵石，常量的解释始终受原子一致性约束。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"L^k_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_{L^k}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\cap L^k_\\tau\\;(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\equiv_{L^k}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)).","display":true},{"tex":"L^k","display":false}],"bytes":1783,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]、[[29-thm-pebble-kvar]] — 博弈刻画"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-pebble-kvar]]"}],"outgoing":["da1408963eb3a178","4de7fc2c34b9d839","711217f22972ffc0","4de8e0c8085801f5","3ee556c64b16809b","44836019093a45c6"]}